{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在屏幕上半部左侧的大字号白色文字，亮度高、面积大，明显是主视觉入口。右上角阶段目录字号小很多，底部音符动画次要。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他突然安静下来，担心有一天对方不再需要自己陪伴，甚至觉得和自己待在一起不自在。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、不安、害怕被嫌弃、担心失去对方的需要。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他想起两人目前仍然亲近，对方一直没有退开，也可能喜欢自己在身边，因此产生了一点高兴；不安并没有消失，只是暂时不再占据全部心思。前后情绪变化以及音乐所对应的细腻情绪层次不容易第一眼拿到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块文字很长，一块里包含担忧、回忆亲近、短暂高兴、冲动收住和情绪暂时平复等多个层次。\",\n    \"后半段的核心补充信息需要继续扫读，不能仅凭开头完整理解这一刻复杂的情绪状态。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "223b2027-c065-4066-ae35-84c28c2c747d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T014608317870Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.485, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:47:08.805463+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4dc0343d2ce3d7837edeae4e96f43d6636d63f2b7c36c91b499ee6f108f161b5", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308